WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Although I have known for a long time that my second uncle is interested in my boat

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,800
But I always thought he was planning to have sex for nothing

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
I didn’t expect that old thing to actually want to spend money on it.

4
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:09,630
But why do you have to come to me?

5
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,030
Isn't it good to spend money to buy new ones?

6
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:13,430
Second uncle's behavior is a bit abnormal

7
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:17,230
It seems like you kid doesn’t know what the boats in the village are saying.

8
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:19,830
Since you went out to sea several times to get good goods,

9
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,030
Everyone in the village is on the boat

10
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,630
Talk about your little wooden boat

11
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,630
It is a ship that has been protected by the Dragon King.

12
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:28,610
I've got a lot of stuff

13
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:32,010
On the one hand, I have decades of experience in my previous life to lay the groundwork.

14
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,700
On the other hand, it is also because I am willing to endure hardships

15
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,760
These people can't see my efforts

16
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:38,890
Instead, think about metaphysics

17
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,520
It's really ridiculous

18
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,580
So my second uncle just believed their lies.

19
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,860
That's why you want to buy my boat, right?

20
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,920
How much does he plan to pay?

21
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:59,210
Zhang Tiezhu went to my house today

22
00:00:59,410 --> 00:01:01,010
There are so many good things to say

23
00:01:01,210 --> 00:01:03,010
This is the only thing I didn't mention
